  qrCodeID: "Ar\u0131za Tespit Mod\xFCl\xFC (Darbe Jenerat\xF6r\xFC)"
  title: "Ar\u0131za Tespit Mod\xFCl\xFC (Darbe Jenerat\xF6r\xFC)"
  icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 2a19aaadcf7844142a73ce60950ec353, type: 3}
  message: "Ar\u0131za Tespit Mod\xFCl\xFC, **yer alt\u0131 enerji kablolar\u0131ndaki
    ar\u0131za noktalar\u0131n\u0131n tespit edilmesi** amac\u0131yla kullan\u0131l\u0131r.
    Test \xF6ncesinde kablonun yal\u0131t\u0131m durumu de\u011Ferlendirilerek dayanabilece\u011Fi
    enerji seviyesi belirlenir. Ard\u0131ndan kontroll\xFC y\xFCksek gerilim darbeleri
    uygulanarak ar\u0131za noktas\u0131nda olu\u015Fan ses veya elektromanyetik sinyal
    yard\u0131m\u0131yla ar\u0131zan\u0131n yeri tespit edilir.\r\n\r\nMod\xFCl,
    noktasal ar\u0131za tespitinde kullan\u0131lan saha ekipmanlar\u0131yla birlikte
    \xE7al\u0131\u015F\u0131r ve kablo ar\u0131zalar\u0131n\u0131n h\u0131zl\u0131
    ve do\u011Fru \u015Fekilde belirlenmesine yard\u0131mc\u0131 olur. \xDCzerindeki
    USB ba\u011Flant\u0131s\u0131 ise test verilerinin bilgisayara aktar\u0131lmas\u0131
    ve kay\u0131t alt\u0131na al\u0131nmas\u0131 amac\u0131yla kullan\u0131l\u0131r."
